<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="HEB" style="id">- Matumbi Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">AEBRANIA</para>
  <para style="toc3">Ebr</para>
  <para style="toc2">Aebrania</para>
  <para style="toc1">Balua ya Pauli kwa Aebrania</para>
  <para style="mt1">Aebrania</para>
  <para style="mt2">Balua ya Pauli kwa Aebrania</para>
  <para style="imt">Kilongolyo</para>
  <para style="ip">Kitabu sa Aebrania nga balua yaisenga mwoyo na ilaya mu'lu' Yesu mwatimisike Maandiko ga ulondoli wa Nnu'ngu' mu Lilagano lya Kwai'mbu'. Balua yi' iandikilwe kati utuba yo nwaya. Nkati ya balua ya Aebrania kubile na ngu'mbu'ku'mbu' ya Lilagano lya kwai'mbu' yaipi'ta 60, ilaya mpu'la mu'lu' Yesu mwatimisike ulondoli woti na mengo ga Mpi'ndo Nku'lu' wa dini. Kwa kitumbu si' kitabu si'no saabinilwe kibe so senga myoyo kwa Akilisitu babaabile ba lubelekwo lwa Kiyahudi. Balua ya Aebrania ilaya mu'lu' Yesu mwaitimisike salya ya Musa li'nga nambi'yambi' api'ndo aku'lu' ba dini kanebabe kai' na kitumbu so piya salaka ya kibi'ki'lyo. Yesu aabile kibi'ki'lyo sakibu'yite masambi goti, tumbulya paawile mukiwo sa nsalaba na ata milele. Akilisitu babatama mu lenji yitu ya li'no, bawesa sengelwa mwoyo na balua ya Aebrania li'nga bayendeli kummi'ngi'ya Yesu Kilisitu kwa mwanjaa, ywembe ywakisake ywatupanga twenga tuwese kuntumikia Nnu'ngu' na ata yendelya kuntumikia (12:2).</para>
  <para style="ip">Ntu'pu' ywatangite munomuno panga, nyai ywaiandike balua kwa Aebrania, lakini asomi ba ilimu ya Bibilia baapayite kwali'kiya panga, iwesapanga yumo ywa atatu ba, yani Pauli, Luka au Balanaba. Kai', mwaka wo andikilwa balua yi' utanganikweli, lakini baingi bau'bi'lya panga yaandikilwe nsu'gu' ya mwaka 70 bu'ka po belekwa kwa Yesu Kilisitu. Muyi wa Yelusalemu waabomwanilwe mu mwaka wa 70 bu'ka po belekwa kwa Yesu Kilisitu, lakini mwandiki wa balua yi' alongelya muyi wa Yelusalemu pawaabile balo bomolelwa. Balua kwa Aebrania yaandikilwe mumuyi wa Roma (13:24) na yendawesekana panga, yaatiti'li'ti'yi'lwa li'nga isomelwe mu makanisa gambone.</para>
  <para style="iot">Mutasali</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Mwandiki alaya panga, Yesu Kilisitu ywangama na nku'lu' kwapi'ta alondoli na malaika ba Nnu'ngu' <char style="ior">(<ref loc="HEB 1:1-4:13">1:1-4:13</ref>)</char>.</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Ayendelya laya panga, Yesu ywangama na nku'lu' kwapi'ta api'ndo ba dini babatumika nkati ya Nyumba ya Nnu'ngu' ya Yelusalemu <char style="ior">(<ref loc="HEB 4:14-7:28">4:14-7:28</ref>)</char>.</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Kai', alaya panga kasi ya Yesu yangama na ibile na uku'lu' kulikoni yi'lu' ya salya ya Musa na Nnu'ngu' <char style="ior">(<ref loc="HEB 8:1-10:31">8:1-10:31</ref>)</char>.</para>
  <para style="io1">4. Aawanikia panga Yesu nga nku'lu' kwa mwomwoti, mwandiki ayendelya piya malagyo gagapalikwa pangilwa kasi kwa iyendo <char style="ior">(<ref loc="HEB 10:32-13:17">10:32-13:17</ref>)</char>.</para>
  <para style="io1">5. Kuundi'la, mwandiki ayomolya uandiki wa balua yake kwo piya salamu <char style="ior">(<ref loc="HEB 13:18-25">13:18-25</ref>)</char>.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="HEB 1" />
  <para style="s1">Nnu'ngu' alongela kwa ndi'la ya Mwana wake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 1:1" />Kwai'mbu', Nnu'ngu' aalongei na au'ku' bitu kwo pi'tya alondoli bake. Aalongei nabo mala yambone na kwa ndi'la mbali'mbali'. <verse eid="HEB 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 1:2" />Lakini kwa masu'ba gano ga kuundi'la, alongei na twenga kwo pi'tya Mwana wake ywammi'i panga nnisi wa yoti, kai', kwa ywembe aaumbike dunia. <verse eid="HEB 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 1:3" />Aywo Mwana alaya ng'alang'atya kwa utukupu wa Nnu'ngu' na ube wake. Aipanga ili'be yoti ikamwane pamope kwa uweso wa liyi'gi'yo lyake. Nembe aaipiyite apange salaka ya kwapeletea bandu masambi gabe, aayi'i kunani no tama kummalyo ga Nnu'ngu' Nku'lu'.<verse eid="HEB 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Uku'lu' wa Mwana wa Nnu'ngu'</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 1:4" />Nnu'ngu' aampangite Mwana wake abe nku'lu' kulikoni malaika kati mu'lu' mwaampei lina liku'lu' kulikoni lya malaika. <verse eid="HEB 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 1:5" />Kwa mwanjaa, ntu'pu' malaika ywoywoti ywaabakiyilwe na Nnu'ngu' panga, <char style="qt">“Wenga wa Mwana wangu', nenga li'no nipangike na Tati' bako.”</char> Wala ammakiyeli malaika ywoywoti, <char style="qt">“Nenga naapanga na Tati' bake, naywembe aapanga Mwana wangu'.”</char> <verse eid="HEB 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 1:6" />Kai', Nnu'ngu' palu' pantumike Mwana wake mmele padunia aabaike, <char style="qt">“Malaika bangu' boti bankilikiti.”</char> <verse eid="HEB 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 1:7" />Lakini bu'kana na malaika aatibaya, <char style="qt">“Aapangite malaika bake babe kati nsunga, na atumisi bake kati malimi ga mwoto.”</char> <verse eid="HEB 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 1:8" />Lakini bu'kana na Mwana, Nnu'ngu' aatibaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:8">
    <char style="qt">Kiti'gu' sako sa lenji, wa Nnu'ngu', saakonda pangali yomoka! </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:8">
    <char style="qt">Wenga watawala bandu bako kwa aki. </char><verse eid="HEB 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 1:9" />
    <char style="qt">Wenga upenda aki no sukya ulau. </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:9">
    <char style="qt">Ngapo Nnu'ngu', Nnu'ngu' wako, akubawi kwa lyengo lyake </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:9">
    <char style="qt">kwa kukumiminikiya mauta ga pulaa ngu'lu' kulikoni aino. </char><verse eid="HEB 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 1:10" />Na kai',</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:10">
    <char style="qt">“Bwana, kwai'mbu' wenga waumbike dunia, </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:10">
    <char style="qt">kunani nga lyengo lya maboko gako. </char><verse eid="HEB 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 1:11" />
    <char style="qt">Yoti yaabu'ka, lakini wenga waigala masu'ba goti, </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:11">
    <char style="qt">yoti yaumala kati ngu'bo. </char><verse eid="HEB 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 1:12" />
    <char style="qt">Waaituwana kati likoti, </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:12">
    <char style="qt">nayembe yaagalambuyilwa kati ngu'bo. </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:12">
    <char style="qt">Lakini wenga wa yu'yu'lu'yu'lu' masu'ba goti, </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:12">
    <char style="qt">na maisa gako gaayomokali.” </char><verse eid="HEB 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 1:13" />Nnu'ngu' ammakiyeli katu ata yumo ywa malaika bake, <char style="qt">“Utame kummalyo gangu', mpaka naabi'ke andumu bako pai' ya magu'lu' gako.”</char> <verse eid="HEB 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 1:14" />Malaika nga namani, ila loo babantumikia Nnu'ngu' no tumilwa kwayangatia balu' babakosopolelwa na Nnu'ngu'.<verse eid="HEB 1:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="HEB 2" />
  <para style="s1">Ukosopoli nku'lu'</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 2:1" />Kwa nyo, tupalikwa tama minyo muno kugakamwa gatuyi'ganilwe, li'nga twaakane kugaleka bu'ka mundi'la ya kakape. <verse eid="HEB 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 2:2" />Lilagano lya salya lyabaapeyilwe au'ku' bitu, baalipoki kwa malaika wa Nnu'ngu', lyaai lya kakape. Kwa nyo, bandu boti babaapangite umbu'ku'su' wo yu'wa, Nnu'ngu' aapwati bu'kana na masambi gabe. <verse eid="HEB 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 2:3" />Twengale buli! Tulu'a yepa buli ukumu mana katuusalawa ukosopoli nku'lu' kati wu'? Wembe, waatumbwi bayilwa na Bwana, bu'kapo ngaukong'ondelwa kwitu na babannyu'wine panga kweli. <verse eid="HEB 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 2:4" />Nnu'ngu' nembe aakong'ondeli ukosopoli wo kwo laya myasu, maayabu na makakala ga sampuli yambone, na kwa upo ya Loo Mpeleteu kati mwapendi mwene.<verse eid="HEB 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mpi'ndo ywa ukosopoli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 2:5" />Nnu'ngu' aabi'ili malaika baitawale dunia yayambi' yatuilongelya abali yake. <verse eid="HEB 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 2:6" />Kai', Maandiko Mapeleteu gabaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 2:6">
    <char style="qt">“Mundu nga namani ata unng'wasili, </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 2:6">
    <char style="qt">Mundu nga ki'li' ata unku'mbu'ki? </char><verse eid="HEB 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 2:7" />
    <char style="qt">Wampangite baa pai' ya malaika pasini bai, </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 2:7">
    <char style="qt">Unng'walike taji ya utukupu na isima, </char><verse eid="HEB 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 2:8" />
    <char style="qt">ngabi'ka kila kili'be pai' ya magu'lu' gake.” </char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="HEB 2:8">Ibayilwa panga, Nnu'ngu' ammi'i Kilisitu <char style="qt">abe ntawala wa ili'be yoti, </char> lombolya pangali kukileka ata kili'be simo. Ata nyo, nambi'yambi' tummonali <char style="qt">kaitawala ili'be yoti.</char> <verse eid="HEB 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 2:9" />Lakini tummona Yesu ywembe Nnu'ngu' <char style="qt">aampangite nsene kulikoni malaika, pasini bai.</char> Aapangite nyo li'nga kwa ndi'la ya ngu'ngu' yake, Yesu awee kwa kitumbu sa kwakosopolya bandu boti. Kwa kitumbu so teselwa no waa kwake, Nnu'ngu' aampei utukupu na isima. <verse eid="HEB 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 2:10" />Yaabile aki panga Nnu'ngu' ywaumbike na kwipanga ili'be yoti ibe kati mwaibile, aampangite Yesu abe ntimilika kabisa kwa ndi'la ya mateso li'nga aalete bana bambone bapange kiselele muutukupu wake, kwa mwanjaa ywembe ngaalongoya kuukosopoli.<verse eid="HEB 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 2:11" />Kwa mwanjaa, Yesu na bandu baapeleteya masambi gabe, Tati' babe bamo, naso nga kitumbu panga aibonali oni kwakema alongobe. <verse eid="HEB 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 2:12" />Kati mwabaya, <char style="qt">“We Nnu'ngu', naalu'a kwayaulya alongo bangu' abali yako. Naalu'a kulumba kwa myambo, patukwembana kwa kitumbu sako.”</char> <verse eid="HEB 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 2:13" />Kai' abaya, <char style="qt">“Liu'bi'lyo lyangu' nammi'kya Nnu'ngu'.”</char> Kai' abaya, <char style="qt">“Nenga nibile pano pamope na bana baanipei Nnu'ngu'.” </char><verse eid="HEB 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 2:14" />Bai, kwa mwanjaa bana babile na yi'ga na myai, naywembe nyinyonyo apangite kiselele kwa gogogo, li'nga kwa ndi'la ya kiwo amwalabiye yu'lu' ywaabile na makakala ga kiwo, lombolya Ibilisi. <verse eid="HEB 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 2:15" />Kai', Yesu aawile li'nga kwabi'ka ulu bandu babaabile abanda kwa kitumbu so yogopa kiwo mumaisa gabe goti. <verse eid="HEB 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 2:16" />Kwa mwanjaa kakape panga, ywembe aaisili kwayangatia malaika, ila kwayangatia bababile ba lubelekwo lwa Bulaimu. <verse eid="HEB 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 2:17" />Kwa kitumbu so, aapalikwe abe kati mwababile akinalongobe kwa makowe goti, li'nga abe mpi'ndo nku'lu' ywa dini ywaabile na kiya no u'bi'li'ka mumengo gake nnu'ngi' ya Nnu'ngu'. Kwa ndi'la yo, aawesite kwipiya salaka ya kwaawana bandu na Nnu'ngu', li'nga Nnu'ngu' aasami bandu masambi gabe. <verse eid="HEB 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 2:18" />Na kwa mwanjaa Yesu aatipayilwa no ku'su'mbu'lwa, awesa kwayangatia balu' babapayilwa.<verse eid="HEB 2:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="HEB 3" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu nku'lu' kulikoni Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 3:1" />Bai, mwenga mwaalongo bangu' mwamukemilwe na Nnu'ngu' panga mwabandu bake apeleteu, muwase bu'kana na Yesu, ywatunkema Ntumilwe ywa Nnu'ngu' na kai' Mpi'ndo Nku'lu' ywitu ywa dini. <verse eid="HEB 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 3:2" />Ywembe aatiu'bi'lika kwa Nnu'ngu' ywaansawi apange lyengo lyake kati mu'lu' Musa mwaau'bi'like munyumba ya Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="HEB 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 3:3" />Nsengi wa nyumba apalikwa peyelwa isima kulikoni nyumba yaisengite. Nyinyonyo, nembe Yesu apalikwa isimilwa muno kulikoni Musa. <verse eid="HEB 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 3:4" />Kila nyumba isengilwe na nsengi, lakini Nnu'ngu' nga nsengi wa kila kili'be. <verse eid="HEB 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 3:5" />Musa <char style="qt">aabile ntumisi mwu'bi'li'ka kwa bandu boti ba munyumba ya Nnu'ngu'.</char> Lyengo lyake lyaai kwabakia bandu bo makowe ga Nnu'ngu' gaalu'a longela masu'ba ga nnu'ngi'. <verse eid="HEB 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 3:6" />Lakini Kilisitu nga Mwana mwu'bi'li'ka, ywayi'mi'li'ka bandu ba nyumba ya Nnu'ngu'. Na twenga nga twabandu bo, mana twayendelya kangamala mpaka kuundi'la na kwipunia mugalu' gatugau'bi'lya.<verse eid="HEB 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kipu'mu'lyo sa Nnu'ngu' sabaapeyelwa bandu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 3:7" />Kwa nyo, kati mwabaya Loo Mpeleteu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:7">
    <char style="qt">“Li'no mana muliyu'wine lilobe lya Nnu'ngu', </char><verse eid="HEB 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 3:8" />
    <char style="qt">kanemwipange myoyo yinu minonopau, </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:8">
    <char style="qt">kati au'ku' binu mwabaapangite nsimu wu'lu' pabannei Nnu'ngu',</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:8">
    <char style="qt">kati nsimu wu'lu' wa mapayilwo ku'lu' kulupu'ngu'ti'. </char><verse eid="HEB 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 3:9" />
    <char style="qt">Akwo, au'ku' binu baatinipaya na kunipekeseni, </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:9">
    <char style="qt">pamope no panga baaibweni iyendo yangu' kwa myaka alubaini! </char><verse eid="HEB 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 3:10" />
    <char style="qt">Kwa kitumbu so, naatikwausikya bandu bo nganibaya, </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:10">
    <char style="qt">‘Mawaso ga bandu ba gayelengine, </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:10">
    <char style="qt">banapatali kugatanga katu mali'la gangu'.’ </char><verse eid="HEB 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 3:11" />
    <char style="qt">Bai, naatiusika nganilapa, </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:11">
    <char style="qt">‘Katu, bandu bo baayingyali pandu pangu' po pu'mu'lya panaabi'kile.’” </char><verse eid="HEB 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 3:12" />Bai, mwaalongo bangu', mwili'ndi'le pakati yinu kanekube na mundu mwene mwoyo nnau wangau'bi'lya, wawibi'ka kuutalu na Nnu'ngu' mwene ukoti. <verse eid="HEB 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 3:13" />Kwa mwanjaa, li'lu' liyi'gi'yo lyalibaya “Li'no” balo lituli'nga twenga. Mupalikwa yangatiana wakati woti li'nga mundu ywoywoti mukipi'nga sinu aakane baa na mwoyo nnonopau kwa kitumbu so kongelwa na sambi. <verse eid="HEB 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 3:14" />Kwa mwanjaa, twenga twaboti tutama kiselele na Kilisitu mana twayendelya kamwa liu'bi'lyo lyatutumbwi nalyo mpaka kuundi'la.<verse eid="HEB 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 3:15" />Maandiko Mapeleteu gabaya nnyanya, <char style="qt">“Li'no mana muliyu'wine lilobe lya Nnu'ngu', kanemwipange myoyo yinu minonopau, kati au'ku' binu mwabaapangite nsimu wu'lu' pabannei Nnu'ngu'.” </char><verse eid="HEB 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 3:16" />Kinyai babaayu'wine lilobe lya Nnu'ngu' na kunneka? Abo, nga balu' boti babaalongoyilwe na Musa bu'ka Misili. <verse eid="HEB 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 3:17" />Kai', kinyai babaamusile myaka alubaini? Nengite balu' babaapangite sambi na <char style="qt">mitwii yabe yaatu'mbu'ki kulupu'ngu'ti'?</char> <verse eid="HEB 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 3:18" />Kai', kinyai babaalapilwe na Nnu'ngu' panga baayingyali mukipu'mu'lyo saabi'kile? Nengite balu' babaakani kunnyu'wa? <verse eid="HEB 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 3:19" />Bai, twibona panga baawesiteli yingya kwa kitumbu so kotoka u'bi'lya kwabe.<verse eid="HEB 3:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="HEB 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 4:1" />Bai, kwa mwanjaa lilagano lyo yingya mukipu'mu'lyo sake likabalo, tutame minyo li'nga yumo ywitu aakane koselwa yingya. <verse eid="HEB 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 4:2" />Kwa mwanjaa, Abali Inannoga ialilwe kwitu twenga kati mwayaalilwe kwa abo bandu ba kwai'mbu'. Lakini liyi'gi'yo lyo lyaapwaikeli, kwa mwanjaa baaliyu'wine lakini baalipokili kwa imani. <verse eid="HEB 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 4:3" />Bai, twenga twatuu'bi'lya tupata kipu'mu'lyo so saalagi Nnu'ngu', kati mwaabaike, <char style="qt">“Naatiusika nganilapa, ‘Katu, bandu bo baayingyali pandu pangu' po pu'mu'lya panaabi'kile.’”</char> Nnu'ngu' aalongei go pamope no panga lyengo lyake lyo umba dunia lyayomwike. <verse eid="HEB 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 4:4" />Bu'kana na lisu'ba lya saba Maandiko Mapeleteu gabaya, <char style="qt">“Nnu'ngu' aapu'mu'li lisu'ba lya saba, aagalei mengo gake goti.”</char> <verse eid="HEB 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 4:5" />Lakini kati mwanibaite, Nnu'ngu' aabaite panga, <char style="qt">“‘Katu, bandu bo baayingyali pandu pangu' po pu'mu'lya panaabi'kile.’”</char> <verse eid="HEB 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 4:6" />Bai, alyo lilagano lyo yingya likabalo, kwa mwanjaa balu' babaalongoli aalilwa Abali Inannoga baasindwi yingya mo kwa kitumbu so kotoka yu'wa kwabe. <verse eid="HEB 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 4:7" />Kwa kitumbu si', Nnu'ngu' abi'ka kai' lisu'ba li'ngi' lyalikemelwa “Li'no.” Nembe aalibaite lisu'ba li'lu' myaka ya nsu'gu' kwa ndi'la ya Daudi, bu'kana na Maandiko gagalongoli bayilwa, <char style="qt">“Li'no mana muliyu'wine lilobe lya Nnu'ngu', kanemwipange myoyo yinu minonopau.” </char><verse eid="HEB 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 4:8" />Kenda Yoshua akaaikiya bandu pandu pakipu'mu'lyo, Nnu'ngu' alu'e longelyali kai' bu'kana na lisu'ba li'ngi' lyo pu'mu'lya. <verse eid="HEB 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 4:9" />Kwa nyo, balo kubile na lisu'ba lya kipu'mu'lyo sa Sabato kwa bandu ba Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="HEB 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 4:10" />Mwanjaa, kila ywayingya pakipu'mu'lyo sa Nnu'ngu' aalu'a pu'mu'lya bu'ka mulyengo lyake kati mu'lu' Nnu'ngu' mwaapu'mu'lile bu'ka mulyengo lyake. <verse eid="HEB 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 4:11" />Bai, tukasane yingya mukipu'mu'lyo so li'nga aakane baa yumo ywitu ywaalu'a koselwa yingya kwo kotoka yu'wa kati mwabaapangite bembe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="HEB 4:11">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Two-edged sword - GT00140" file="Two-edgedSword_Heb4.12_GT00140.jpg" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Gordon Thompson © Wycliffe Bible Translators Inc., 2012." ref="4:11" /> <verse eid="HEB 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 4:12" />Liyi'gi'yo lya Nnu'ngu' lyu'mi na libile na makakala. Bwu'gi wake upi'ta lipanga lyalitema ku'no na ku'no. Lipuwana kabisa mpaka paukwembana mwoyo na loo, na paikwembana ili'mbi'li'mbi' ya yi'ga na mauta ga mukyupa. Liyi'gi'yo lyo, lyendapekeseni no tanga mawaso na mabinio ga myoyo ya bandu. <verse eid="HEB 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 4:13" />Ntu'pu' kyumbe sakiiyanika kwa Nnu'ngu'. Ili'be yoti kwake ywembe yumukulilwe, na kwake ywembe twaapalikwa awanikia iyendo yitu yoti.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="HEB 4:13">Yesu, mpi'ndo nku'lu' ywa dini</para>
  <para style="p" vid="HEB 4:13">
    <figure style="fig" alt="High Priest - GT00139" file="HighPriest_Heb2.17_GT00139.jpg" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Gordon Thompson © Wycliffe Bible Translators Inc., 2012." ref="4:13" /> <verse eid="HEB 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 4:14" />Bai, tubile na mpi'ndo nku'lu' ywa dini ywaayi'i no yingya mpaka kunani, Yesu Mwana wa Nnu'ngu'. Kwa kitumbu so, tugakamuliye gatugau'bi'lya. <verse eid="HEB 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 4:15" />Mpi'ndo ywa Dini ywo, ngaywatangite ukigopi witu, kwa mwanjaa aapayilwe kwa mali'la goti kati twenga, lakini ywembe aapangiteli sambi. <verse eid="HEB 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 4:16" />Kwa nyo, tukangamale egelya nnu'ngi' ya kiti'gu' sa kikulungwa sa Nnu'ngu' mwene ngu'ngu', li'nga atubi'ki kiya na kutuyangatia kwa ngu'ngu' yake patupalikwa yangatiyilwa.<verse eid="HEB 4:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="HEB 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 5:1" />Kwa mwanjaa, kila mpi'ndo nku'lu' ywa dini ayi'mi'kilwe kuntumikia Nnu'ngu' kwa kitumbu sa bandu li'nga apiye mapiyo na salaka kwa kitumbu sa sambi. <verse eid="HEB 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 5:2" />Kwa mwanjaa mwene nkigopi, awesa kwabi'kya kiya balu' babapanga makosa pangali tanga. <verse eid="HEB 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 5:3" />Kwa nyo, apalikwa piya salaka kwenda kwa bandu bi'ngi' baili, ila na kwa kitumbu sa masambi gake mwene. <verse eid="HEB 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 5:4" />Ntu'pu' mundu ywawesa kwipeya mwene isima ya kwipanga mpi'ndo ywa dini. Kila mundu asaulilwa na Nnu'ngu' apange mpi'ndo ywa dini kati mwaabile Aluni.<verse eid="HEB 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 5:5" />Nyinyonyo nembe Kilisitu aaipangiteli mwene isima yo panga mpi'ndo ywa dini, ila mwene Nnu'ngu' ngansawile na kummakia, <char style="qt">“Wenga wa Mwana wangu', nenga li'no nipangike na Tati' bako.”</char> <verse eid="HEB 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 5:6" />Aalongei kai' pandu pi'ngi', <char style="qt">“Wenga nga wampi'ndo ywa dini milele kati mwaabile Melkisedeki.” </char><verse eid="HEB 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 5:7" />Yesu aatami pano padunia, kwa kili'lo kiku'lu' na moli, kasalya na kunnu'ba Nnu'ngu' mwene uweso wa kunkosopolya bu'ka kiwo. Kwa mwanjaa apangage isima kwa Nnu'ngu', nembe ngannyu'wa. <verse eid="HEB 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 5:8" />Pamope no panga Yesu aai Mwana wa Nnu'ngu', aaiyi'ganiye yu'wa kwa ndi'la ya mateso gagampatage. <verse eid="HEB 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 5:9" />Bu'kana na lyo, Nnu'ngu' aampangite Yesu abe kitumbu sa ukosopoli wa milele, kwa boti babannyu'wa. <verse eid="HEB 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 5:10" />Nembe Nnu'ngu' ngansawa panga mpi'ndo nku'lu' ywa dini <char style="qt">kati mwaabile Melkisedeki.</char><verse eid="HEB 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Likwi'li'ko bu'kana no kotoka yu'wa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 5:11" />Tubile na makowe gambone go longela bu'kana na Yesu panga mpi'ndo ywa dini, lakini inonwipe kummakiyanga, kwa mwanjaa mwenga mwatopau bo tanga. <verse eid="HEB 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 5:12" />Sai'no mwenga mwaapalikwe panga mwa balimu, lakini mukabalo pala mundu ywa kunnyi'gana, mayi'gano malongoi ga liyi'gi'yo lya Nnu'ngu'. Mupalikwa pelya mabele paali pa kilyo kinonopau. <verse eid="HEB 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 5:13" />Kila ywapalikwa pelya mabele bai akabalo mwana, nnangu'ta atangiteli makowe ga aki nga kili'gani. <verse eid="HEB 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 5:14" />Lakini kilyo kinonopau kili'ngana kwa bandu akomala, babayobelile no tanga manogau na maakau.<verse eid="HEB 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="HEB 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 6:1" />Kwa nyo kanetuki'li'bu'ki mayi'gano galu' malongoi gagabu'kana na Kilisitu, ila tuyendeli kasana kwiyi'gana, li'nga tube twaakomala muimani. Kai' kanetuyendeli bi'ka nsingi wa mayi'gano go galambuka bu'kana na yendo yaileta kiwo na ga kumwu'bi'lya Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="HEB 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 6:2" />Kai' kanetuyendeli kwiyi'gana mayi'gano ga kwipeleteya yi'ga, ga kwabi'kya bandu moko, ga uyu'ki wa awi'li, na ga ukumu yangayomoka. <verse eid="HEB 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 6:3" />Na ago ngatulu'a panga, mana aapenda Nnu'ngu'.<verse eid="HEB 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 6:4" />Bai, baabile bandu babaapeyilwe bweya no pata upo ya kunani, ngabapangilwa umope na Loo Mpeleteu, <verse eid="HEB 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 6:5" />balu' babaapayite unogau wa Liyi'gi'yo lya Nnu'ngu' na makakala ga utawala wa dunia yayaaisa, <verse eid="HEB 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 6:6" />bu'kapo mana batu'mbwike muimani yo, iwesekanali kwaki'li'bu'ya li'nga bapate galambuka mala yi'ngi' kai' bu'ka muiyendo yabe ndau. Kwa mwanjaa, bammamba Mwana wa Nnu'ngu' pampanda pabi'li' na kumwisia nnu'ngi' ya bandu.<verse eid="HEB 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 6:7" />Bwi' waunni'li'lwa ula mala yambone no piya ili'be mbali'mbali' ya kumpwaika nni'mi, awo uteyaliwa na Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="HEB 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 6:8" />Lakini bwi' mana kaubaliya mikongo ya mimimwa na manyei, apo ntu'pu' pwaila kwa nni'mi, Nnu'ngu' aikosya lasi na kuundi'la yake kuisonja mwoto.<verse eid="HEB 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 6:9" />Lakini mwaapendwa bangu', ata ikatei nilongela nya, nibile na ukakape panga mupanga manogau gagalaya panga mukosopolilwe. <verse eid="HEB 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 6:10" />Nnu'ngu' nga mwene aki, na aalibalyali yendo yinu inannoga yamupangite na upendo wamuulayite kwa kitumbu sake, kwa kwayangatia aumini ainu bu'ka kwamutumbwile mpaka nambi'yambi'. <verse eid="HEB 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 6:11" />Kilu'lu' situ kila yumo ywinu ayendeli kasana panga nyinyonyo mpaka kuundi'la wake, li'nga galu' gamugau'bi'lya gatimi. <verse eid="HEB 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 6:12" />Bai, kanemube mwaakata ila mube nsawani na balu' babau'bi'lya no komeya, baapoki galu' goti gaalagi Nnu'ngu'.<verse eid="HEB 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lilagano lya Nnu'ngu' nga kakape</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 6:13" />Nnu'ngu' paampei Bulaimu lilagano lyake, aalapike kwa lina lyake mwene, kwa mwanjaa paabileli na ywoywoti ywaabile nku'lu' kumpi'ta ywembe. <verse eid="HEB 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 6:14" />Nnu'ngu' ngabaya, <char style="qt">“Kakape nilu'a kuyalya na kukupeya lubelekwo lwambone.”</char> <verse eid="HEB 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 6:15" />Bulaimu aali'ndike kwo komeya, bu'kapo nga pokya si'lu' saalagilwe na Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="HEB 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 6:16" />Bandu batumya lina lya mundu ywabile nku'lu' muno pi'ta bene li'nga panga lilagyo lyene kilapo. Kilapo kikong'ondelya panga sakilongelelwa nga sa kakape na ntu'pu' ntau bu'kana na so. <verse eid="HEB 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 6:17" />Nyinyonyo Nnu'ngu' aalikong'ondeli lilagano lyake kwa kilapo. Aapangite nyo kwo pala laya kwa bandu mpu'la panga, babaapokya lilagano lyake lyagalambukali. <verse eid="HEB 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 6:18" />Nnu'ngu' aapangite ili'be yi' ibi'li', lilagano na kilapo, panga katu aagalambuyali kwa mwanjaa ywembe mmu'su'li. Aapangite nyo li'nga kutuyi'ya mwoyo twatubutuki kasake tuli'ndi'ndi liu'bi'lyo lya makowe gagaaisa. <verse eid="HEB 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 6:19" />Liu'bi'lyo lyatubile nalyo nga kati kiyi'mi'kyo situ, kikangamala na sa kakape sakituli'ndi'la kiyenda mpaka nsu'gu' ya panjia mulwingo lwa papeleteu muno munyumba ya Nnu'ngu' kunani. <verse eid="HEB 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 6:20" />Yesu aalongoli yingya pandu palu' kwa kitumbu situ. Apangilwe <char style="qt">mpi'ndo nku'lu' ywa dini ywangali yomoka, kati mwaabile Melkisedeki.</char><verse eid="HEB 6:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="HEB 7" />
  <para style="s">Mpi'ndo ywa dini Melkisedeki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 7:1" />
    <char style="qt">Melkisedeki aai nkulungwa wa Salemu, na mpi'ndo ywa dini ya Nnu'ngu' Nku'lu', Bulaimu paabile kagobwa bu'ka kungondo kwaabulige akulungwa apo aakwembine na Melkisedeki, nembe ngannyalya Bulaimu.</char> <verse eid="HEB 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 7:2" /><char style="qt">Bulaimu aampei lumo kwa ku'mi ya kila kili'be sabile naso.</char> Na lina lya Melkisedeki lilombolya, “Nkulungwa wa Aki” na kai', <char style="qt">“Nkulungwa wa Salemu,”</char> lombolya “Nkulungwa wa Amani.” <verse eid="HEB 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 7:3" />Ibayilwa panga abelei ba Melkisedeki, wala lukolo lwake lutanganikweli kai' belekwa no waa kwake kutanganikweli. Ywembe mpi'ndo nku'lu' ywa dini wa milele kati Mwana wa Nnu'ngu'.<verse eid="HEB 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 7:4" />Lolange aywo Melkisedeki mwaabile nku'lu', ata tati' bitu aku'lu' Bulaimu bampei lumo kwa ku'mi ya ili'be yoti yabaapokonywi kungondo. <verse eid="HEB 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 7:5" />Bu'kana na salya ya Musa, bandu ba nyumba ya Lawi bababile api'ndo ba dini, bapalikwa pokya lumo kwa ku'mi ya ili'be bu'ka kwa alongo babe ata ikatei nabembe ba lukolo lwa Bulaimu. <verse eid="HEB 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 7:6" />Aywo Melkisedeki ywembe aabileli ywa lukolo lwa Lawi, lakini ata nyo aapokile lumo kwa ku'mi ya ili'be bu'ka kwa Bulaimu. Na Melkisedeki ngaanyalya Bulaimu ywaapeyilwe lilagano na Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="HEB 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 7:7" />Kakape itanganikwe panga ywayalya nga nku'lu' kuliko ywayaliwa. <verse eid="HEB 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 7:8" />Api'ndo ba dini babapokya lumo kwa ku'mi, bano bandu babawaa. Lakini Melkisedeki ywapoki lumo kwa ku'mi bu'ka kwa Bulaimu ywembe balo nkoti kati mwagabaya Maandiko Mapeleteu. <verse eid="HEB 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 7:9" />Bulaimu aapiyike lumo kwa ku'mi kwa Melkisedeki, na ata Lawi ywembe lukolo lwake lwalupokya lumo kwa ku'mi. Tuwesa baya panga, Lawi aapiyike kwa Melkisedeki kwo pi'tya au'ku'be Bulaimu. <verse eid="HEB 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 7:10" />Bulaimu paakwembine na Melkisedeki, Lawi aabile balo belekwa, lakini aabile nkati ya myai ya au'ku'be Bulaimu.<verse eid="HEB 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 7:11" />Baisilaili baapeyilwe salya ya Musa, na salya yo yabu'kine na upi'ndo nku'lu' wa dini ya Lawi. Ata nyo upi'ndo wa dini wo watimilikeli, kwa kitumbu so ngaapalikwa mpi'ndo ywi'ngi' ywa dini ywabile kati Melkisedeki na ywabu'ka panja ya lukolo lwa Aluni. <verse eid="HEB 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 7:12" />Kwa mwanjaa paugalambuka upi'ndo wa dini, salya nayembe ipalikwa galambuyilwa. <verse eid="HEB 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 7:13" />Mpi'ndo nku'lu' wa dini ywalongelelwa pano nga Bwana Yesu, ywembe aabileli Nnawi. Kai' ntu'pu' ywaabile mpangakasi wa upi'ndo nku'lu' wa dini ywabu'kite mulukolo lwake. <verse eid="HEB 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 7:14" />Mwanjaa itanganikwe panga Bwana witu aapitike mulukolo lwa Yuda, lukolo lwo Musa alongeili bu'kana na upi'ndo wa dini.<verse eid="HEB 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mpi'ndo ywi'ngi' ywa dini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 7:15" />Makowe go gabile mpu'la muno kwa mwanjaa, mpi'ndo ywi'ngi' ywa dini ywabile kati Melkisedeki apitike. <verse eid="HEB 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 7:16" />Ywembe apangilweli mpi'ndo ywa dini kwa kitumbu so timisa salya yaibaya panga api'ndo ba dini bapite mulukolo lwa Lawi. Ila apangilwe mpi'ndo ywa dini kwa kitumbu sa makakala gake ga ukoti wangayomoka. <verse eid="HEB 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 7:17" />Kwa mwanjaa Maandiko gakong'ondelya panga, <char style="qt">“Wenga wa mpi'ndo ywa dini milele, kati mwaabile Melkisedeki.”</char> <verse eid="HEB 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 7:18" />Bai, amuli ya kwai'mbu' iputilwe kwa mwanjaa yaai ya ukigopi na yangali pwaika. <verse eid="HEB 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 7:19" />Kwa mwanjaa salya ya Musa yawesikeli timilisa likowe lyolyoti. Lakini nambi'yambi' tupeyilwe liu'bi'lyo li'ngi' linogau muno lyalitupanga tukombwe kumwegelya Nnu'ngu'.<verse eid="HEB 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 7:20" />Pamope na go, Nnu'ngu' aabi'kite lilagano lya kumpanga Yesu abe mpi'ndo nku'lu' ywa dini kwa kilapo. Lakini bandu bi'ngi' pabaapangilwe api'ndo ba dini kwaabile ntu'pu' kilapo. <verse eid="HEB 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 7:21" />Lakini Yesu apangilwe mpi'ndo nku'lu' ywa dini kwa kilapo sa Nnu'ngu'. Nnu'ngu' atikummakia, <char style="qt">“Bwana abi'ka lilagano kwa kilapo, naywembe aagalambuyali maganio gake. Wenga wampi'ndo ywa dini milele.”</char> <verse eid="HEB 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 7:22" />Kwa kitumbu sa kilapo si' ilombolya panga Yesu nga ukakape wa lilagano lyalibile linannoga muno kulikoni li'lu' lya nsimu wa Musa.<verse eid="HEB 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 7:23" />Nsimu wa lilagano lya kwai'mbu' api'ndo ba dini baabile bambone, kwa mwanjaa baayendeli lili kwipanga kasi yabe kwa kitumbu so waa. <verse eid="HEB 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 7:24" />Lakini Yesu abileli kati bembe, ywembe ywa milele na upi'ndo wake wa dini wa milele. <verse eid="HEB 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 7:25" />Kwa nyo ywembe akombwa kwakosopolya mpamo bandu boti babamwisilya Nnu'ngu' kwo pi'tya ywembe, kwa mwanjaa ywembe nkoti milele na endakwalu'bya masu'ba goti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="HEB 7:25">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Altar with burnt offering and priest - CN02093" file="AltarWithBurntOffering&amp;Priest_CN02093.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by David C. Cook © David C. Cook Publishing Co., 1978." ref="7:25" /> <verse eid="HEB 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 7:26" />Mpi'ndo nku'lu' ywa dini wa sampuli yi' nga ywatumpala muno kasitu kwa mwanjaa, ywembe ntu'pu' kipi'li', mpeleteu, ntu'pu' likosa, abi'kilwe kuutalu na bene sambi no tu'ndu'bi'yi'lwa kunani. <verse eid="HEB 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 7:27" />Yesu abileli nsawani na api'ndo bi'ngi' ba dini. Balu' babaapalikwe wi'ti' piya salaka kila lisu'ba kwa kitumbu sa masambi gabe bene, bu'kapo ga bandu, ila ywembe aapiyike salaka yimo bai kwa nsimu woti, kai' aipiyike mwene. <verse eid="HEB 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 7:28" />Salya ya Musa isawage bandu akigopi kwapanga api'ndo aku'lu' ba dini nsawani na bandu boti. Lakini bu'ka pasalya yo, Nnu'ngu' alapite kilapo sakumpanga Mwana apange mpi'ndo nku'lu' ywa dini ywabile ntimilika milele.<verse eid="HEB 7:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="HEB 8" />
  <para style="s">Yesu mpi'ndo witu nku'lu' wa dini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 8:1" />Bai, likowe lya ngama mumakowe goti gatulongela nga ali', panga tubile nakwe mpi'ndo nku'lu' ywa dini wa sampuli yi' ywatama kummalyo ga kiti'gu' sa lenji sa Nnu'ngu' Nku'lu'. <verse eid="HEB 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 8:2" />Ywembe apanga lyengo lya upi'ndo nku'lu' wa dini pandu papeleteu muno nkati ya ema ya kweli yaisengilwe na Nnu'ngu', na kwenda bandu lili.<verse eid="HEB 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 8:3" />Kila mpi'ndo nku'lu' ywa dini abi'kilwe li'nga piya salaka na mapiyo gi'ngi'. Bu'kana na go, yapalikwe ata Kilisitu abe naso kili'be sa kumpikia Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="HEB 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 8:4" />Ikapangage Yesu akayendelya tama pano padunia alu'e pangali mpi'ndo nku'lu' ywa dini, kwa mwanjaa, babile api'ndo aku'lu' ba dini babapiya salaka bu'kana na salya ya Musa. <verse eid="HEB 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 8:5" />Lyengo lya api'ndo aku'lu' ba dini lyabalipanga palu' papeleteu, nga kati mpwano na kiwili sa galu' gagabile pandu papeleteu akwo kunani. Aso nga kitumbu sa Musa nsimu wa kwibi'ka wiso senga ema ya kunkilikitya Nnu'ngu', Nnu'ngu' aammakiye panga, <char style="qt">“Utengenese kila kili'be kati mwanaakulayite ku'lu' kukitu'mbi' sa Sinai.”</char> <verse eid="HEB 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 8:6" />Nnu'ngu' ampei Yesu lyengo lya upi'ndo nku'lu' wa dini waunogite muno kulikoni api'ndo aku'lu' ba dini babalongolile. Yesu nga ywaawana bandu na Nnu'ngu' mulilagano linannoga kulikoni li'lu' lilongoi, kai' lilagano lyo lisengilwe munsingi unannoga muno kulikoni li'lu' lya kwai'mbu'.<verse eid="HEB 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 8:7" />Ikapangage li'lu' lilagano lya kwai'mbu' lili'nganikiye kulu'e panga ntu'pu' kitumbu sa lilagano linebi'li'. <verse eid="HEB 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 8:8" />Nnu'ngu' aakwi'like bandu bake kabaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:8">
    <char style="qt">“Masu'ba gendaisa abaya Bwana, </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:8">
    <char style="qt">panaalipanga lilagano lyayambi' </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:8">
    <char style="qt">kwa bandu ba Isilaili na ba Yuda. </char><verse eid="HEB 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 8:9" />
    <char style="qt">Lilagano lyangu' li'no, lipangali kati li'lu' lyanalipangite na au'ku' babe,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:9">
    <char style="qt">panaalongwiye wiso bu'ka ku Misili. </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:9">
    <char style="qt">Bembe baau'bi'likeli mulilagano lyangu', </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:9">
    <char style="qt">na nenga nganaaleka, abaya Bwana. </char><verse eid="HEB 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 8:10" />
    <char style="qt">Li'no nga lilagano lyanilu'a panga munyumba ya Isilaili kwa masu'ba gagaisa, abaya Bwana.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:10">
    <char style="qt">Naalu'a kwibi'ka salya yangu' mulunda lwabe, </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:10">
    <char style="qt">na kwiandika mumyoyo yabe, </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:10">
    <char style="qt">naapanga na Nnu'ngu' wabe </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:10">
    <char style="qt">na bembe baapanga bandu bangu'. </char><verse eid="HEB 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 8:11" />
    <char style="qt">Kwapanga ntu'pu' mundu ywaalu'a kunnyi'gana nnyine </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:11">
    <char style="qt">wala kummakia nnongowe panga, </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:11">
    <char style="qt">‘Untange Bwana Nnu'ngu',’ </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:11">
    <char style="qt">boti tumbulya nnangu'ta mpaka mpi'ndo, baanitanga. </char><verse eid="HEB 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 8:12" />
    <char style="qt">Naasamya ulau wabe, </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:12">
    <char style="qt">na, naaku'mbu'kyali masambi gabe.” </char><verse eid="HEB 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 8:13" />Nnu'ngu' paalikemite lilagano li'no lyayambi', aalipangite li'lu' lilongoi lipange ligona. Kili'be kigona, aso kiegelya yomokya.<verse eid="HEB 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="HEB 9" />
  <para style="s">Ibala ya padunia na ya kunani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Tabernacle aerial view - LB00259" file="TabernacleAerialView_LB00259.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Horace Knowles revised by Louise Bass © The British &amp; Foreign Bible Society, 1994." ref="9:0" /> <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 9:1" />Lilagano li'lu' lilongoi lyabile na amuli yake yo kilikitya, kai' paabile na papeleteu pake pakidunia. <verse eid="HEB 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 9:2" />Paasengilwe ema, na pangu'lu' yake paakemilwe pandu papeleteu, na paabile na pandu po bi'ka kimulikyo na mesa ya makati gagaapiyilwe kwa Nnu'ngu'. <figure style="fig" alt="Tabernacle furnishings - BK00278" file="TabernacleFurnishings_BK00278.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Horace Knowles revised by Louise Bass © The British &amp; Foreign Bible Society, 1994." ref="9:2" /> <verse eid="HEB 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 9:3" />Na nsu'gu' ya panjia yenebi'li', kwakemilwe Papeleteu Muno. <verse eid="HEB 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 9:4" />Akwo kungati kwabile na kibi'ki'lyo so ukikiya ubani sakitengenesilwe na zaabu. Na kai' kwabile lisanduku lya lilagano, lyaliwambilwe na zaabu na nkati yake kwabile na kiteleko sa zaabu sakibile na likati lyalikemelwa mana, pimbo ya Aluni yayaabile yipwike, na yi'lu' ibao ibi'li' ya maliwe yaiandikilwe lilagano. <verse eid="HEB 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 9:5" />Na panani ya lisanduku lyo paabile na pisa ya yumbe yene mapapayo yailaya utukupu wa Nnu'ngu', na mapapayo go gaawi'ki'li kiti'gu' so samya masambi. Lakini nambi'yambi' kwenda nga nsimu wo awanikia mpu'la makowe aga goti lili. <figure style="fig" alt="Ark of covenant - GT00145" file="ArkOfCovenant_Heb9.4-5_GT00145.jpg" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Gordon Thompson © Wycliffe Bible Translators Inc., 2012." ref="9:5" /><verse eid="HEB 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 9:6" />Bai ili'be yoti payaabi'kilwe wiso, api'ndo aku'lu' ba dini baayingi kila lisu'ba pangu'lu' ya ema li'nga panga ibala. <verse eid="HEB 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 9:7" />Lakini mpi'ndo nku'lu' ywa dini bai ngaywaayi'ki'tilwe yingya kungati ya ema, naywembe apangage nyo mala yimo bai kwa mwaka, ku'no apu'twile myai ya kumpikia Nnu'ngu' kwa kitumbu sa masambi gake mwene na kwa masambi ga bandu bi'ngi' gagapangilwe pangali tanga. <verse eid="HEB 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 9:8" />Bu'kana na makowe ga goti, nsimu woti wa pangu'lu' ya ema kapapanga kasi, Loo Mpeleteu aabile kalaya panga ndi'la yo yingya Pandu Papeleteu Muno paabile panayu'gu'li'lwali. <verse eid="HEB 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 9:9" />Wu'no nga mpwano kwitu nambi'yambi', panga salaka na mapiyo mbali'mbali' gagapiyilwa kwa Nnu'ngu' gakombwali kumpanga yu'lu' ywakilikita abe mundu mwene mwoyo ntimilika. <verse eid="HEB 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 9:10" />Aga goti gagabu'kana na ilyo, inywo na kwipeleteya yi'ga nga makowe ga padunia bai, na makakala gake gaayomwike palu' Nnu'ngu' paabi'i wiso ndi'la yake yayambi'.<verse eid="HEB 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 9:11" />Kilisitu aaisi li'nga abe Mpi'ndo Nku'lu' ywa dini kwa makowe manogau gagaisile. Ywembe apanga kasi muema inannoga muno, kai' yaitimilike kulikoni ema yailongolile. Ema yo isengilweli na moko ga bandu, lombolya ya padunia yi'noli. <verse eid="HEB 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 9:12" />Ywembe aayingi Pandu Papeleteu Muno mala yimo bai, kwa nsimu woti. Ywembe apelikeli salaka ya myai ya mbwi na ya ng'ombe, ila myai yake mwene. Kwa ndi'la yi'lu', ngatukosopolya milele. <verse eid="HEB 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 9:13" />Bandu babaabalangilwe panga asapu bu'kana na mimu, baapeleteyilwe kwa ndi'la ya kwanyunyikiya myai ya mbwi na ya ng'ombe na maligu gagabu'kana na likinda lya ng'ombe lyalitiniyilwe. <verse eid="HEB 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 9:14" />Bai, myai ya Kilisitu ibile na makakala muno kulikoni myai ya inyama yo, ywembe aaipiyite kwa Nnu'ngu' kwa makakala ga Loo wa milele li'nga apange salaka yangali kipi'li' sosoti. Myai yake ngayaitupeleteya myoyo yitu bu'kana na iyendo yaileta kiwo, li'nga tuntumikiye Nnu'ngu' ywabile nkoti.<verse eid="HEB 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 9:15" />Kwa nyo, Kilisitu nga mwawaniyi wa bandu na Nnu'ngu' mulilagano lyayambi', li'nga bandu babasaulilwe na Nnu'ngu' bapate balaka yangayomoka yaalagile. Makowe go gawesa pangika kwa mwanjaa Kilisitu aawile li'nga kwakosopolya bandu bu'ka mumasambi gabaapangite mulilagano lya kwai'mbu'.<verse eid="HEB 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 9:16" />Mundu mana aandike usia wa ulisi wa ili'be yake, usia wo waalu'a panga kasi palu' paalu'a yomoka yu'lu' ywaandike bai. <verse eid="HEB 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 9:17" />Kwa mwanjaa usia wa ulisi upanga kasi palu' bai paipanga ywaandike ayomwike, na kwenda abile balo akalamali. <verse eid="HEB 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 9:18" />Si'no nga kitumbu sa lilagano lya kwai'mbu' panga lyaapangite kasi kwa ndi'la yo yitanika kwa myai. <verse eid="HEB 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 9:19" />Musa paanwayite salya yoti kwa bandu boti, aatweti myai ya likinda lya ng'ombe na ya mbwi no yangabana na masi'. Naywembe nganyunyikiya myai yo mukitabu sa salya na kwa bandu boti, kwo tumya manyoya makele ga ngondolo gagaatabilwe mulutambi' lwa nkongo waukemelwa hisopo. <verse eid="HEB 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 9:20" />Musa aatibaya, <char style="qt">“Yi'no nga myai yaipanga lilagano lya Nnu'ngu' lyamwaamuliswe, muliyu'we.”</char> <verse eid="HEB 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 9:21" />Kai' Musa aainyunyikiye myai yo muema na kwa kila kili'be sakitumika muibala. <verse eid="HEB 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 9:22" />Salya ibaya panga, kwa mwanjaa kila kili'be kipeleteyelwa kwa myai, nayembe sambi nyinyonyo, ibu'yi'lwa kwo yitanika myai.<verse eid="HEB 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Salaka ya Kilisitu ibu'ya masambi ga bandu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 9:23" />Makowe go gaabile kiwili sa makowe ga kibelekwe kunani, gagaapalikwe peleteyelwa kwa salaka ya inyama. Lakini makowe ga kibelekwe ga kunani gapalikwa baa na salaka ya ngama munomuno. <verse eid="HEB 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 9:24" />Kwa mwanjaa Kilisitu aayingili Pandu Papeleteu Muno papaasengilwe na bandu, pandu po pai kiwili sa pandu pakakape papabile kunani. Ila aayingi kunani kwene na akwo nambi'yambi' endakutulu'bya nnu'ngi' ya Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="HEB 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 9:25" />Mpi'ndo nku'lu' ywa dini aayingya Papeleteu Muno abile na myai ya inyama mala yimo kila mwaka. Lakini Kilisitu aayingili kunani li'nga aipiye panga salaka mala yambone, ila mala yimo bai. <verse eid="HEB 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 9:26" />Ikapangage nyoli, Kilisitu alu'e palikwa ku'su'mbu'lwa mala yambone bu'ka umbilwa kwa dunia. Lakini mumasu'ba gano ga kuundi'la, aisi kwipia mwene salaka mala yimo bai kwa nsimu woti, li'nga kutusamya masambi gitu. <verse eid="HEB 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 9:27" />Bai amo ngamwaibile panga kila mundu apalikwa waa mala yimo bai, no bu'ka po ukumilwa na Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="HEB 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 9:28" />Nyinyonyo Kilisitu apiyilwe panga salaka mala yimo bai, li'nga agapu'twe masambi ga bandu baingi. Kai' paalu'a isa pampanda pabi'li', aaisali bu'ya masambi, Ila kwapeya ukosopoli balu' bandu babanni'nda kwo binia muno.<verse eid="HEB 9:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="HEB 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 10:1" />Mwanjaa salya nga kiwili bai sa makowe ganannoga gagaalu'a isa, na kwenda nga makowe gene lili. Kwa nyo, salaka yabapiya bandu kila mwaka bu'kana na salya yo, katu iwesali kwapeletea bandu babamwu'bi'lya Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="HEB 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 10:2" />Ikapangage kakape ayo salaka yabe iwesa peleteya masambi gabe, balu'e yendelyali kwiukumu panga babile na sambi, na salaka ayo yoti, ilu'e ika kuundi'la. <verse eid="HEB 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 10:3" />Lakini salaka yabapiya kila mwaka ipanga yaaku'mbu'ki'ya masambi gabe, <verse eid="HEB 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 10:4" />kwa mwanjaa iwesekanali myai ya malu'me ga ng'ombe na mbwi bu'ya sambi.<verse eid="HEB 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 10:5" />Kwa nyo Kilisitu paabile kaisa padunia, ammakiye Nnu'ngu',</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:5">
    <char style="qt">“Wenga waapendili salaka wala mapiyo, lakini unibi'ki wiso yi'ga. </char><verse eid="HEB 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 10:6" />
    <char style="qt">Wenga upendili salaka yo tiniya, wala salaka yo samya sambi. </char><verse eid="HEB 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 10:7" />
    <char style="qt">Apo nganibaya, ‘Nibile pano wa Nnu'ngu', li'nga timisa gopendile, kati mwaiandikilwe mu Maandiko Mapeleteu bu'kana na nenga.’” </char><verse eid="HEB 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 10:8" />Kilisitu aabaite wi'ti', <char style="qt">“Wenga waapendili salaka wala mapiyo, </char> na <char style="qt">salaka yo tiniya, wala salaka yo samya sambi.”</char> Aabaite nyo pamope no panga salaka yoti ipiyilwa bu'kana na salya ya Musa. <verse eid="HEB 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 10:9" />Bu'kapo ngabaya, <char style="qt">“Nibile pano wa Nnu'ngu', li'nga timisa gopendile.”</char> Kwa nyo Nnu'ngu' ngabu'ya salaka ayo nongoi no bi'ka salaka yimo kwa ndi'la ya Kilisitu. <verse eid="HEB 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 10:10" />Kwa mwanjaa Yesu Kilisitu aatimisike mwapendi Nnu'ngu' kwa ndi'la ya salaka ya yi'ga yake yayaapiyilwe mala yimo bai kwa nsimu woti, twenga tupeleteyelwa masambi gitu.<verse eid="HEB 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 10:11" />Kila mpi'ndo ywa dini ayi'ma kila lisu'ba panga ibala, no kokotya piya salaka yi'yi'lu'yi'lu', yangali wesa samya sambi katu. <verse eid="HEB 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 10:12" />Lakini Kilisitu aaipiyike panga salaka mala yimo bai kwa nsimu woti li'nga atubu'ki'ye masambi gitu. Bu'kapo <char style="qt">ngatama kuluboko lwamalyo lwa Nnu'ngu', </char> <verse eid="HEB 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 10:13" />na akwo aali'nda mpaka <char style="qt">Nnu'ngu' paalu'a kwabi'ka andumu bake pai' ya magu'lu' gake.</char> <verse eid="HEB 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 10:14" />Bai, kwa salaka yake yimo, Kilisitu ngaatimilisa bandu bake milele, nga balu' boti babapeleteyelwa masambi gabe.<verse eid="HEB 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 10:15" />Na ywembe Loo Mpeleteu atukong'ondelya bu'kana na likowe li'. Abaya wi'ti', <verse eid="HEB 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 10:16" /><char style="qt">“Li'no nga lilagano lyanilu'a panga nabo kwa masu'ba gagaisa, abaya Bwana. Nilu'a bi'ka salya yangu' mumyoyo yabe no andika mulunda lwabe.”</char> <verse eid="HEB 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 10:17" />Bu'kapo ngayongeya baya, <char style="qt">“Naalu'a ku'mbu'kyali kai' masambi gabe, wala ulau wa iyendo yabe.”</char> <verse eid="HEB 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 10:18" />Bai, manaitei Nnu'ngu' ayomwike kwasamya bandu masambi gabe, ipanga ntu'pu' kitumbu kai' so piya salaka yo samya sambi.<verse eid="HEB 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tumwegeleli Nnu'ngu'</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 10:19" />Kwa nyo mwaalongo bangu', kwa kitumbu sa myai ya Yesu tubi'kilwe ulu yingya Papeleteu Muno pangali bwoga, <verse eid="HEB 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 10:20" />kwo pi'tya li'lu' panjia, lombolya yi'ga yake, ngayaituyu'gu'li ndi'la yayambi' na ya ukoti. <verse eid="HEB 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 10:21" />Twenga tubile na mpi'ndo nku'lu' ywa dini ywaiyi'mya nyumba ya Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="HEB 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 10:22" />Kwa nyo tumwegeli Nnu'ngu' tubile na myoyo ya kweli na kumwu'bi'lya kwo timilika, kwa mwanjaa Nnu'ngu' aapeletiye myoyo yitu milau kwa ndi'la ya myai ya Yesu na yi'ga yitu yaapeleteyilwe na masi' malengebau. <verse eid="HEB 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 10:23" />Tupalikwa kamulikiya si'lu' satukiu'bi'lya, kwa mwanjaa Nnu'ngu' ywaalagile nga ywau'bi'li'ka. <verse eid="HEB 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 10:24" />Tukabwane no ku'mbu'ki'yana twabene na bene, li'nga tupendane no panga makowe ganannoga. <verse eid="HEB 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 10:25" />Wala kanetukotoke kwembana pamope kati bi'ngi' mwabakotoka kwembana. Ila tupalikwa yendelya sengana muno, kwa mwanjaa tutangite panga lisu'ba lyo buya Bwana lyegelile.<verse eid="HEB 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 10:26" />Mana katuyendelya panga sambi kwa lipu'njo ku'no katuutanga ukakape, ntu'pu' salaka yaiwesa piyilwa kai' kwa kitumbu so bu'ya sambi. <verse eid="HEB 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 10:27" />Apo sakiigala ngo li'nda kwa bwoga ukumu, na <char style="qt">mwoto nkali' wauyaka, wawaalu'a kwalangamisa andumu ba Nnu'ngu'.</char> <verse eid="HEB 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 10:28" />Mundu ywoywoti ywaaitauki salya ya Musa, aabulagilwe pangali kiya, <char style="qt">kwa ukong'ondeli wa bandu abi'li' au atatu.</char> <verse eid="HEB 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 10:29" />Buli, muganiya mbwatyo yaku' ngali' yapalikwa peyelwa mundu ywansalawa Mwana wa Nnu'ngu', no balanga panga myai ya lilagano lyalipeleteya sambi kili'be sa ngamali? Buli, apalikwa pangilwa namani yu'lu' ywankupulu Loo Mpeleteu ywa ngu'ngu'? <verse eid="HEB 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="HEB 10:30" />Kwa mwanjaa tuntangite yu'lu' ywabaite, <char style="qt">“Bu'kana no bukiya, nenga nganilu'a bukiya.”</char> Na ywembe ngabaya kai', <char style="qt">“Bwana aalu'a kwaukumu bandu bake.”</char> <verse eid="HEB 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="HEB 10:31" />Likowe lyo yogopelwa muno tu'mbu'ka mumaboko ga Nnu'ngu' ywabile nkoti.<verse eid="HEB 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="HEB 10:32" />Mugaku'mbu'ki masu'ba galu' gamwaatumbwi kumwu'bi'lya Kilisitu, pamope no pi'ta mungu'su'mbu' yambone, lakini mwaayendeli komeya kwo kangamala. <verse eid="HEB 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="HEB 10:33" />Pi'ngi' mwaabile kamupwi'wi'lwa no ku'su'mbu'lwa pabandu. Na pi'ngi' mwaabile kamwaayangatia balu' babapangilwage manyatau. <verse eid="HEB 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="HEB 10:34" />Mwaabi'ki kiya balu' babaabile muutabilwe, kamuyi'ki'tya kwo napusika pokonyolwa mali yinu, kwa mwanjaa mwaatangite panga mubile na mali ya ngama muno na yokonda. <verse eid="HEB 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="HEB 10:35" />Kwa nyo kanemuuleke ukangamau winu, kwa mwanjaa mwaalu'a pokya upo ngu'lu'. <verse eid="HEB 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="HEB 10:36" />Mupalikwa baa na ukomeyi li'nga muwese panga gapendi Nnu'ngu' no pokya si'lu' saalagile. <verse eid="HEB 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="HEB 10:37" />Mwanjaa kati mwagabaya Maandiko, <char style="qt">“Balo pasene bai yu'lu' ywapalikwa isa aalu'a isa, wala asi'yali. </char> <verse eid="HEB 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="HEB 10:38" /><char style="qt">Mundu wangu' mwene aki aalama kwa ndi'la ya imani. Lakini naampulaikyali yu'lu' ywagalambukya nsu'gu' kwa kitumbu so yogopa.”</char> <verse eid="HEB 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="HEB 10:39" />Lakini twenga tubileli mwa bababuyangani nsu'gu' no oba, ila twenga tubile pamope na balu' babamwu'bi'lya no kosopolelwa.<verse eid="HEB 10:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="HEB 11" />
  <para style="s">Imani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 11:1" />Imani ngo baa na ukakape wa makowe gatugalolela, no u'bi'lya mpamo makowe gangali bonekana. <verse eid="HEB 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 11:2" />Mwanjaa imani ya sampuli yi', au'ku' bitu ba kwai'mbu' bampulaise Nnu'ngu'.<verse eid="HEB 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 11:3" />Kwa imani, tutangite panga dunia yaaumbilwe kwa amuli ya Nnu'ngu', ayi' ilombolya panga ili'be yaibonekana, yaaumbilwe kwa ili'be yangali bonekana.<verse eid="HEB 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 11:4" />Kwa imani, Abeli aampikiye Nnu'ngu' salaka inannoga muno kulikoni Kaini. Kwa imani yo Nnu'ngu' ngammalangilya Abeli panga mundu mwene aki kwa kwipokya salaka yake. Pamope no panga Abeli aawile lakini mpaka nambi'yambi' imani yake iyendelya longela kwitu.<verse eid="HEB 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 11:5" />Kwa imani, Enoki aamiyilwe bu'ka mudunia pangali waa. Aabonekineli kai', kwa mwanjaa Nnu'ngu' aantweti yenda kunani. Kwa mwanjaa Maandiko Mapeleteu gabaya panga, paabile balo tolelwa apangage makowe manogau kwa Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="HEB 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 11:6" />Lakini pangali imani iwesekanali kunnogelelya Nnu'ngu', kwa mwanjaa kila mundu ywaisa kwa Nnu'ngu' apalikwa au'bi'li panga Nnu'ngu' abile, na apeya upo balu' babampala kwo binia.<verse eid="HEB 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 11:7" />Kwa imani, Nuu paakwi'li'kilwe na Nnu'ngu' bu'kana na makowe gagaabile balo bonekana, ngannyu'wa na aatengenise safina li'nga kwikosopolya mwene na akinalongobe. Bu'kana na go, dunia yoti ngaiukumilwa. Naywembe Nuu kwa imani yake, ngabalangilwa panga mundu mwene aki kwa Nnu'ngu'.<verse eid="HEB 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 11:8" />Kwa imani, Bulaimu annyu'wine Nnu'ngu' paakemilwe ayende kunni'ma waapeyilwe na Nnu'ngu' ube wake, pamope no panga aatangiteli pandu payenda. <verse eid="HEB 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 11:9" />Kwa imani, aatami kati nng'eni kunni'ma waalagilwe na Nnu'ngu'. Aatami mumaema pamope na Isaki na Yakobi babaapoki malagano gaagalu'galu' bu'ka kwa Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="HEB 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 11:10" />Kwa mwanjaa Bulaimu aabile kaupi'kanilya nni'ma wene misingi yo konda, na mwene Nnu'ngu' ngaywaubi'i wiso na kuusenga. <verse eid="HEB 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 11:11" />Kwa imani Sala pamope no panga aai nng'oi muno, aau'bi'li panga Nnu'ngu' alu'a timisa lilagano lyake, ngayi'ma ndumbo. <verse eid="HEB 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 11:12" />Kwa nyo, bu'kana na mundu yu' yumo yani Bulaimu, ywaabile kati ng'waa, ngababelekwa bandu bambone kati ndondwa ya kumaunde na lwangi lwa kumbwani lwangabalangika.<verse eid="HEB 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 11:13" />Bandu ba boti baawile muimani pangali pokya li'lu' lilagano, lakini baalibweni kwa kuutalu na ngabalikwi'ndi'lya. Na bembe baayi'ki'tile panga, baabile ageni na api'ta ndi'la bai pano padunia. <verse eid="HEB 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 11:14" />Bandu bababaya makowe kati ga, balaya mpu'la panga bapala nni'ma wabe bene. <verse eid="HEB 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 11:15" />Kenda bakaku'mbu'kya nni'ma wabaulei patumbu, balu'e pata lipala lyo buyangania kwo. <verse eid="HEB 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 11:16" />Lakini bandu ba baminyikiya nni'ma unannoga muno, yani nni'ma wa kunani. Kwa nyo Nnu'ngu' aisikali kemelwa Nnu'ngu' wabe, kwa mwanjaa ywembe ayomwike kwabi'kya wiso muyi wabe.<verse eid="HEB 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 11:17" />Kwa imani, Bulaimu paapayilwe na Nnu'ngu' kumpiya salaka mwana wake wa kisake Isaki, aayi'ki'ti kumpiya kwa Nnu'ngu' pamope no panga ywembe ngaywaapoki lilagano lyo, <verse eid="HEB 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 11:18" />kwa mwanjaa Nnu'ngu' ammakiye, <char style="qt">“Kwa ndi'la ya Isaki walu'a pata lubelekwo lwalwaakemelwa lwako.”</char> <verse eid="HEB 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 11:19" />Bulaimu au'bi'li panga Nnu'ngu' awesa kwayu'ya bandu bu'ka kuuwi'li. Nnu'ngu' pankanikiye Bulaimu kummulaga Isaki, yaai nga kati ayu'yi'lwe kai' bu'ka kuuwi'li.<verse eid="HEB 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 11:20" />Kwa imani, Isaki aatikwayalya Yakobi na Esau bu'kana na maisa gabe ga masu'ba gagaaisa. <verse eid="HEB 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 11:21" />Kwa imani, Yakobi paabile kaegelya waa, ngaayalya bana boti abi'li' ba Yusupu, ngankilikitya Nnu'ngu', ku'no <char style="qt">ayegekile ntwe wake mu yi'lu' pimbo yake.</char><verse eid="HEB 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 11:22" />Kwa imani, Yusupu paabile papipi no waa, aabakiye Baisilaili babu'ke na yupa yake pabaabu'ka kunni'ma wa Misili.<verse eid="HEB 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 11:23" />Kwa imani, abelei ba Musa bammwiyite mwana wabe kwa myei itatu bu'ka belekwa, kwa mwanjaa baamweni mwana nng'olou, na wala baaiyogwipeli amuli ya nkulungwa wabe Falao.<verse eid="HEB 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 11:24" />Kwa imani, Musa paakomile, aakani kemelwa mwana wa biti Falao. <verse eid="HEB 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 11:25" />Aibweni nantali pata ngu'su'mbu' pamope na bandu ba Nnu'ngu', kulikoni pulaikya makowe ga sambi kwa masu'ba nsi'si' bai. <verse eid="HEB 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 11:26" />Aibweni pata ngu'su'mbu' kwa kitumbu sa Kilisitu kubile na pwaila ngu'lu' kulikoni utayili woti wa kunni'ma wa Misili, kwa mwanjaa aabile kapi'kanilya pata upo bu'ka kwa Nnu'ngu' kwa masu'ba gagaisa.<verse eid="HEB 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 11:27" />Kwa imani Musa aabu'i Misili pangali yogopa nyongo ya nkulungwa, na aaki'li'bu'kili nsu'gu' kwa mwanjaa, aabile kati mundu ywamweni Nnu'ngu' ywangali bonekana. <verse eid="HEB 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 11:28" />Kwa imani yoyoyo Musa aaibi'i Pasika, ngaabakia Baisilaili bapakaye myai panani ya milyango, li'nga yu'lu' malaika ywalangamisa paapi'ta aakane kwalangamisa abele analu'me ba Baisilaili.<verse eid="HEB 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 11:29" />Kwa imani, Baisilaili baalokite Baali ya Shamu kati batyanga muuyu'mu, lakini Amisili pabaapayite loka, masi' gaatikwawi'ki'lya, boti ngabawaa.<verse eid="HEB 11:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="HEB 11:30" />Kwa imani, ingu'mbi' ya Yeliko yaabomwanike bu'ka pa Baisilaili tyanga kabati'li'ta kwa masu'ba saba. <verse eid="HEB 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="HEB 11:31" />Kwa imani, Rahabu yu'lu' mpege aalangamisweli pamope na balu' babaankani Nnu'ngu', kwa mwanjaa ywembe aakemi balu' apekeseni.<verse eid="HEB 11:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="HEB 11:32" />Bai, nilongele namani kai'? Wakati unili'nganali wo yaulya bu'kana na imani ya Gideoni, Balaki, Samsoni, Yefta, Daudi, Samweli na alondoli. <verse eid="HEB 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="HEB 11:33" />Kwa imani, bandu bo baaku'mbwaniye ngondo na akulungwa, ngabasinda. Baapangite makowe ga aki no pokya gabalagilwe na Nnu'ngu'. Baatabite mikano ya imba. <verse eid="HEB 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="HEB 11:34" />Ngabaimiya mwoto nkali', baaponagilwe bulagilwa kwa lipanga, baabile akigopi lakini Nnu'ngu' ngaapeya makakala. Baabile akangamala mungondo, ngabagasinda mayesi ga kigeni. <verse eid="HEB 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="HEB 11:35" />Alwawa baapoki bandu babe babaabile awaa, bayu'yi'lwe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="HEB 11:35">Lakini bi'ngi' baatiku'su'mbu'lwa na bembe ngabakana yu'gu'li'lwa, li'nga baapate yu'yi'lwa no yingya mumaisa ganannoga muno. <verse eid="HEB 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="HEB 11:36" />Bi'ngi' baatisalangilwa no ku'mbu'lwa mikwasu, na bi'ngi' baatabilwe minyololo no taikulilwa muutabilwe. <verse eid="HEB 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="HEB 11:37" />Na bi'ngi' baaku'mbu'lilwe maliwe no bulagilwa, bi'ngi' baakatilwe ipande ipande na nsumeno, bi'ngi' babulagilwe kwa lipanga. Baati'li'tike ti'li'tike ku'no baweti maki'ngo ga ngondolo na mbwi, baabile bandu aki'ba, bendeteselwa no pangilwa manyatau. <verse eid="HEB 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="HEB 11:38" />Bandu bo baawike mulupu'ngu'ti' na muitu'mbi', baabile kabatama mumapango na mumai'mbwa. Dunia yaapalikweli baa na bandu anogau kati bo.<verse eid="HEB 11:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="HEB 11:39" />Bandu ba boti Nnu'ngu' aatipulaika nabo kwa kitumbu sa imani yabe, lakini ntu'pu' ata yumo ywabe ywaapoki si'lu' sabaalagilwe na Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="HEB 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="HEB 11:40" />Kwa mwanjaa, Nnu'ngu' aalongoli kutubi'kya kili'be sa ngama muno li'nga bembe kanebatimilike pangali twenga.<verse eid="HEB 11:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="HEB 12" />
  <para style="s1">Nnu'ngu' atuyi'gana yu'wa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 12:1" />Bai, natwenga tuti'li'tilwe na kipi'nga kiku'lu' sa akong'ondeli, bai tubi'ke kuutalu kila kipungo sakitukanikia na sambi yi'lu' yaituli'ndi'ndya, li'nga tubutuke muno lubi'lo kwo komeya mumasindano gatubi'kilwe. <verse eid="HEB 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 12:2" />Bai, tupalikwa tunninguli Yesu kwa mwanjaa ywembe ngaywatumbwile na ngannyomoleli wa imani yitu, ywembe aaitangite pulaa yaibi'kilwe nnu'ngi' yake. Aakomiye waa panani ya nsalaba pangali kwibona oni, na nambi'yambi' atami lwingo lwamalyo wa kiti'gu' sa lenji sa Nnu'ngu'.<verse eid="HEB 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 12:3" />Muganiye bu'kana na Yesu ywaakomiye malau ga balu' bene sambi, li'nga mwaakane totokelwa no ti'kwanika mwoyo. <verse eid="HEB 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 12:4" />Pamope no panga mwendakasana muno kwisinda sambi, lakini balo munaku'mbwanali ata ika po yitana myai yinu. <verse eid="HEB 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 12:5" />Buli, mulibalile galu' mayi'gi'yo go yi'ya mwoyo gamubakiyilwe na Nnu'ngu' panga, mwenga mwabana bake? Gagabaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 12:5">
    <char style="qt">“Mwana wangu', kaneusalawe mbwatyo ya Bwana, </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 12:5">
    <char style="qt">wala kaneuti'kwanike mwoyo paakukwi'li'ka. </char><verse eid="HEB 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 12:6" />
    <char style="qt">Mwanjaa Bwana ankwi'li'ka kila ywampenda, na kai' ankwi'li'ka kila ywankema panga mwana wake.” </char><verse eid="HEB 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 12:7" />Kwa nyo mukomeye pamuyi'ganilwa na Nnu'ngu' kwo pwatilwa, apanga nya kwa mwanjaa mwenga mwabana bake. Mwanjaa mwana ywaku' ywangali pwatilwa na mmelei wake? <verse eid="HEB 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 12:8" />Lakini mana mukotwike pwatilwa kati bana bi'ngi', bai, mwenga mwabana ba Nnu'ngu' lili, ila mwabana ba alamu. <verse eid="HEB 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 12:9" />Pamope na go, akinatati' bitu babatupapike, baabile kabatukwi'li'ka, na twenga twendekwaisimu. Buli, Tati' bitu ba kiloo muno lili twenga kwayu'wa, li'nga tupate lama? <verse eid="HEB 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 12:10" />Akinatati' bitu ba dunia baatukwi'li'ke kwa nsimu nsene bai, kati mwabaapendi bene, lakini Nnu'ngu' atukwi'li'ka kwa pwaila yitu, li'nga tupate baa twapeleteu kati ywembe. <verse eid="HEB 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 12:11" />Kwi'li'ki'lwa kwenda likowe lyo pulaikya lili ila lyo usunika, lakini kuundi'la balu' babayi'ganilwe no kwi'li'ki'lwa, batama kwa amani no panga makowe ga aki.<verse eid="HEB 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mayi'gano na makwi'li'ko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 12:12" />Kwa nyo <char style="qt">mugayi'i makakala maboko ginu gagabile ga ukigopi, na mayuwa ginu gagatombolwike.</char> <verse eid="HEB 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 12:13" /><char style="qt">Muyendeli tyanga mundi'la yaisu'mbu'lwike, </char> li'nga si'lu' sakilemile, kanekilumiyilwe, ila kitepulwe.<verse eid="HEB 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 12:14" />Mupale kwo binia tama kwa amani na bandu boti no kasana tama muupeleteu, kwa mwanjaa ntu'pu' mundu ywaawesa kummona Bwana pangali baa nawo. <verse eid="HEB 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 12:15" />Mwilinguli wiso li'nga mundu ywoywoti kaneakoselwe ngu'ngu' ya Nnu'ngu', na <char style="qt">kyi'ki' kibabau saakane ipuka, </char> kwaauya bandu baingi na kwayi'ya usapu bu'kana na so. <verse eid="HEB 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 12:16" />Nyinyonyo mulinguli wiso li'nga nkati yinu kaneabee mundu mpege au ywangali kunkilikitya Nnu'ngu', kati Esau <char style="qt">ywaapi'miye aki yake ya mwana mmele kwa kitumbu sa nkungu gumo wa kilyo.</char> <verse eid="HEB 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 12:17" />Mwenga mutangite panga ata paapalike kwipata kai' yi'lu' balaka yake, aatikanilwa kwa mwanjaa apatikeli lipala lyo galambukya kwa Nnu'ngu', pamope no panga aipalike kwa moli.<verse eid="HEB 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 12:18" />Mwenga, mwai munaikali pandu powesa kupakunywa no yaka mwoto palubi'ndu', na pene kimbu'nga kati kitu'mbi' sa Sinai, <verse eid="HEB 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 12:19" />nyinyonyo, wayu'wanike nnindimo wa lipenga au kati lilobe lya mayi'gi'yo go yogoya mpaka balu' babaayu'wine baalu'bite kanebabakiyilwe liyi'gi'yo li'ngi' kai'. <verse eid="HEB 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 12:20" />Baabaite nya mwanjaa baakombwili komeya amuli yabaapeyilwe na Nnu'ngu' panga, <char style="qt">“Ata mana kinyama saakunywa kitu'mbi' si', saalu'a ku'mbu'lwa maliwe.”</char> <verse eid="HEB 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 12:21" />Goti gagaapitike kukitu'mbi' sa Sinai, bandu gaatikwang'ondoya muno ata mpaka Musa aabaite, <char style="qt">“Nendalendema muno no yogopa.”</char><verse eid="HEB 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 12:22" />Lakini mwenga mwikite kukitu'mbi' sa Sayuni, munni'ma wa Nnu'ngu' ywabile nkoti, Yelusalemu ya kunani. Munni'ma wo, malaika bakongolekine kwa pulaa maelupu kwa maelupu. <verse eid="HEB 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 12:23" />Mwenga mwikite pakipi'nga kiku'lu' sa bana abele ba Nnu'ngu', balu' babaandikilwe maina gabe kunani. Muyi'ma nnu'ngi' ya Nnu'ngu' ywai akimu ywa bandu boti na nnu'ngi' ya loo ya bandu anogau babaapangilwe atimilika na Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="HEB 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 12:24" />Mwikite kwa Yesu ywabile mwawaniyi mulilagano lyayambi', na myai yake yainyunyikilwe, ibaya makowe manogau kulikoni yi'lu' ya Abeli.<verse eid="HEB 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 12:25" />Bai, mwilinguli kanemunkani kumpi'kania yu'lu' ywalongela na mwenga. Manaitei balu' babaakani kumpi'kania ywembe ywaakwi'li'ke pano padunia baakosopolilweli, twenga tulu'a kosopolelwa buli mana katukana kumpi'kania yu'lu' ywatukwi'li'ka bu'ka kunani? <verse eid="HEB 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 12:26" />Nsimu wu'lu' lilobe lyake lyalendemiye dunia, lakini nambi'yambi' alagi panga, <char style="qt">“Naalu'a lendemeya kai' nni'ma woti, na kwenda nni'ma bai lili, ila ata kunani.”</char> <verse eid="HEB 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 12:27" />Liyi'gi'yo li', <char style="qt">“kai'” </char> lilaya mpu'la panga ili'be yaiumbilwe yaalu'a lendema no bu'yi'lwa li'nga iigale ili'be yangali wesa lendema.<verse eid="HEB 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 12:28" />Kwa nyo tupalikwa kunsukulu Nnu'ngu' kwa mwanjaa aatuyi'ki'ti panga kiselele muukulungwa wake pangali lendemeyelwa. Tunkilikiti Nnu'ngu' kwa ndi'la yainnogelelya, kwa isima no yogopa, <verse eid="HEB 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 12:29" />mwanjaa <char style="qt">Nnu'ngu' witu nga kati mwoto wauwesa langamisa. </char><verse eid="HEB 12:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="HEB 13" />
  <para style="s1">Ndi'la ya kunnogelelya Nnu'ngu'</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 13:1" />Muyendeli pendana kati mwaalongo. <verse eid="HEB 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 13:2" />Kanemulibali kwakemya ageni, kwa mwanjaa kwo panga nya bandu bi'ngi' baakemi malaika pangali tanga. <verse eid="HEB 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 13:3" />Mwaku'mbu'ki bababile muutabilwe, kati mutabilwe pamope nabo. Kai' mwaku'mbu'ki balu' babaku'su'mbu'lwa, kati muku'su'mbu'lwa pamope nabo.<verse eid="HEB 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 13:4" />Ndoa ipalikwa iisimilwe na bandu boti, nsengo na nnyumbo bapalikwa baubi'ke kuutalu usapu, kwa mwanjaa Nnu'ngu' aalu'a kwaukumu apege na babapita panja ya ndoa.<verse eid="HEB 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 13:5" />Mugali'ndi'le maisa ginu na kipi'li' so penda mbanje, inni'ngane yi'lu' yamubile nayo, kwa mwanjaa Nnu'ngu' abaya, “Naakulekali katu, wala kukulibalya.” <verse eid="HEB 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 13:6" />Kwa nyo tuwesa lowa baya pangali yogopa, <char style="qt">“Bwana nga nnyangatiyi wangu', naayogopali. Mundu aanipanga ki'li'?” </char><verse eid="HEB 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 13:7" />Mwaku'mbu'ki alongosi binu babannyi'ganiye liyi'gi'yo lya Nnu'ngu'. Mwilinguli miyendo yabaabile nayo mpaka kuundi'la, na muyige imani yabe. <verse eid="HEB 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 13:8" />Yesu Kilisitu nga yu'yu'lu'yu'lu' liso, li'no na ata milele. <verse eid="HEB 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 13:9" />Kanemukongelwe na mayi'gano mbali'mbali', kwa mwanjaa, ngu'ngu' ya Nnu'ngu' nga yaikangamaya myoyo yinu na kwenda salya yaibu'kana na kilyo lili. Salya yo kwa babaikota yayangatiali kili'be.<verse eid="HEB 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 13:10" />Twenga tubile na kibi'ki'lyo panga balu' babantumikia Nnu'ngu' muema ya Ayahudi ntu'pu' aki yo lya salaka yaibu'ka nkati yake. <verse eid="HEB 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 13:11" />Mpi'ndo nku'lu' ywa dini apu'twa myai ya inyama na kwipeleka Papeleteu Muno, li'nga aipiye salaka kwa kitumbu sa sambi. Lakini nyama ya inyama yo yendetolelwa no tiniyilwa kuutalu na pandu pamaema. <verse eid="HEB 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 13:12" />Nyinyonyo na Yesu nembe aaku'su'mbu'lilwe panja ya kilambo, li'nga aapeleteye bandu masambi gabe kwa ndi'la ya myai yake. <verse eid="HEB 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 13:13" />Kwa nyo tunnyendeli panja ya kilambo, na tukomeye oni kati ywembe mwaakomiye. <verse eid="HEB 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 13:14" />Kwa mwanjaa pano padunia ntu'pu' nni'ma wo konda, ila tuupi'kanilya wu'lu' wawisa. <verse eid="HEB 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 13:15" />Bai, tuyendeli kunnumba Nnu'ngu' kwo pi'tya Yesu, kwa mwanjaa sipwa yitu ya kuliyi'ki'tya lina lyake nga salaka yatumpikia. <verse eid="HEB 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 13:16" />Kanemulibali panga makowe manogau no panga kiselele muili'be yinu yamubile nayo, kwa mwanjaa salaka kati yo ngayainnogelelya Nnu'ngu'.<verse eid="HEB 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 13:17" />Mwayu'we alongosi binu no kota amuli yabe, kwa mwanjaa bembe bakeleka kwa kitumbu sa loo yinu, na baalu'a piya isabu ya utumisi wabe nnu'ngi' ya Nnu'ngu'. Mana mwaayu'wa, baalu'a panga kasi kwa pulaa, ila mana baapanga kwo usunika, mwapatali pwaila.<verse eid="HEB 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 13:18" />Muyendeli kutulu'bya, kwa mwanjaa tubile na zamili mbeleteu yo pala tama kwa nnyendo unannoga kwa bandu boti. <verse eid="HEB 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 13:19" />Ninnu'ba munilu'bi muno, li'nga Nnu'ngu' aniki'li'bu'ye kai' kwinu kiyu'ngu'ya.<verse eid="HEB 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 13:20" />Nnu'ngu' wa amani aannyu'yite Bwana witu Yesu, nsungi nku'lu' wa ngondolo, kwa kitumbu so yitana myai yake yaipanga malagano ga milele. <verse eid="HEB 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 13:21" />Nnu'ngu' ampange mwenga mube mwaatimilika mukila nnyendo unannoga, apange gagannogelelya nkati yitu kwa ndi'la ya Yesu Kilisitu. Utukupu ube kasake milele na milele. Amina.<verse eid="HEB 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mayi'gi'yo ga kuundi'la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 13:22" />Mwaalongo bangu', ninnu'banga muno mugapoki mayi'gi'yo gano go kwi'li'ka mwanjaa nimwandiki kwa mayi'gi'yo masene bai. <verse eid="HEB 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 13:23" />Nipala mutange panga nnongo witu Timoteo ayu'gu'lilwe bu'ka muutabilwe, mana aaika kiyu'ngu'ya, naalu'a isa pamope nakwe kuntyangilya.<verse eid="HEB 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 13:24" />Mwasalimie alongosi binu boti pamope na apeleteu boti. Alongo ba Italia bendakunsalimia. <verse eid="HEB 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 13:25" />Ngu'ngu' ya Nnu'ngu' ibe pamope na mwenga.<verse eid="HEB 13:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 13" />
</usx>